meta {
  name: Get my profile
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/me/profile
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  The caller's own profile, and the site's onboarding check.

  The two failure codes mean different things and the frontend routes on the
  difference: 401 is "not logged in at all", 404 is "logged in but no profile yet,
  go to onboarding".

  - 200 the profile
  - 401 missing or invalid token
  - 404 authenticated but not onboarded
}
